format: 2
name: equals between PubKeyHash and ScriptHash (E11, T29)
class: Probe
method: m
arg: 420102
expect: REJECT JULC0078
note: ADR-067 E11: retained (open question 2).
note: ADR-068 M6: on the only frontend, javac, REJECT JULC0078; the JavaParser frontend answered DIVERGE T29 Value/Value.
